  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 301.13 “New Hampshire Coalition Against Domestic and Sexual Violence (NHCADSV)” means an umbrella organization for a statewide network of 13 independent member programs committed to ending domestic and sexual violence.\n\nSource. #8719, eff 11-1-06; ss by #8930, eff 7-4-07; ss by #9674, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12634, eff 10-2-18 (formerly Fam 301.12)",
